ts. It never performs the calculations 4, 12, or 6, and ends with an unsupported final answer \u2018#### 6\u2019, illustrating a paraphrase loop with no actual reasoning."), mdx("b", null, "Summary "), mdx("p", null, "Across these four categories, we find that:"), mdx("ul", null, mdx("li", {
